e", "text": "", "level": 0, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "page": 11, "table": {"id": "t11-1", "caption": "表5  EMC 要求", "headers": ["项 目/项目分类", "项 目/测试项目", "标 准（或测试条件）", "-", "性能判/据", "性能判/-", "备 注"], "rows": [["EMI", "传导骚扰发射", "CLASS A", "低3dB", "低3dB", "低3dB", "EN55022"], ["EMI", "辐射骚扰发射", "CLASS A", "低3dB", "低3dB", "低3dB", "EN55022"], ["EMS", "静电放电抗扰<br>性", "气放电8KV,接触放电6KV", "B", "B", "B", "EN 55024"], ["EMS", "电快速脉冲群<br>抗扰性", "±2KV", "B", "B", "B", "YD/T1082"], ["EMS", "浪涌抗扰性", "差模：±2KV（耦合阻抗0 欧姆）<br>共模：±2KV（耦合阻抗0 欧姆）<br>1.2/50μS（8/20μS）混合波形", "B", "B", "B", "YD/T993"]], "marks": ["rowspan:2@col0;colspan:2@row0", "rowspan:2@col2", "rowspan:2@col3", "rowspan:2@col5", "rowspan:2@col6", "colspan:3@row2", "colspan:3@row3", "rowspan:3@col0", "colspan:3@row4", "colspan:3@row5", "colspan:3@row6", "flattened_header"], "confidence": 0.88, "source": {"page": 11, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "provider": "local", "marks": ["rowspan:2@col0;colspan:2@row0", "rowspan:2@col2", "rowspan:2@col3", "rowspan:2@col5", "rowspan:2@col6", "colspan:3@row2", "colspan:3@row3", "rowspan:3@col0", "colspan:3@row4", "colspan:3@row5", "colspan:3@row6", "flattened_header"]}}}, {"kind": "paragraph", "text": "性能判据：\nA：电源在整个测试过程中，性能没有任何降低，完全和电源规格书中规定的指标相同。\nB：测试过程中，电源的性能允许暂时降低，但测试结束后能够恢复正常。测试过程中", "level": 0, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "page": 11, "table": null}, {"kind": "paragraph", "text": "不能掉电、复位。\nC：允许出现短时的功能丧失，但测试结束能够自动或者人工干预下恢复正常。\nR：测试过程中不允许出现除保险器件外其它器件的损坏。", "level": 0, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "page": 11, "table": null}, {"kind": "paragraph", "text": "2022-02-24\n浩鑫机密，未经许可不得扩散\n第11页, 共16页", "level": 0, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "page": 11, "table": null}, {"kind": "paragraph", "text": "CY0177-75V-20A 规格书\n机密", "level": 0, "section_path": "7 EMC 要求", "page": 12, "table": null}, {"kind": "heading", "text": "8 软件通讯协议", "level": 1, "section_path": "8 软件通讯协议", "page": 12, "table": null}, {"kind": "heading", "text": "9 安规认证要求", "level": 1, "section_path": "9 安规认证要求", "page": 12, "table": nul